OL,3,GNEWSADJ Vagrant Real Estate wins
OL,4,AScottish Album of Year 2026
OL,5,
OL,6,FAberdeen DJ and hip-hop producer
OL,7,FVagrant Real Estate has won the 2026
OL,8,FScottish Album of the Year award.
OL,10,FA moniker for Nick Cronin, Vagrant Real
OL,11,FEstate triumphed with "Neither Collar
OL,12,FNor Crown".
OL,14,FHe scooped the #20,000 first prize
OL,15,Fafter emerging from a shortlist which
OL,16,Fincluded Barry Can't Swim and Hen Hoose
OL,17,FCollective.
OL,19,F"This is a bit mad, I fully did not
OL,20,Fexpect this at all," he said.
